MSVSCode IDE CoPilotAI
The error `Uncaught SyntaxError: Unexpected token 'export'` typically occurs when you try to use ES6 module syntax (`export`) in a script that is not being treated as a module. To fix this, you need to ensure that the script is loaded as a module.

You can do this by adding the `type="module"` attribute to the `<script>` tag that includes

chess.js

. Here's the updated code:

